Package: autotiss2fa
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Eren Tomurcuk <erentomurcuk@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Firefox extension for automatic TU Wien 2FA
AutoFactorAuthenticator / AutoTISS2FA - Auto-fills TOTP codes for TU Wien login.
The TOTP seed is stored in the system keyring (Secret Service).
This is NOT an official tool by TU Wien.
Depends: libdbus-1-3
Recommends: zenity | kdialog

# Dependency note (fixed in 1.2): the host links libdbus-1.so.3 and nothing
# else (readelf on the shipped binary). The old "Depends: libsecret-1-0" was
# fictional - libsecret was never linked, and a system WITH libsecret but
# WITHOUT dbus was still left broken. Run-time keyring access needs a Secret
# Service provider (GNOME Keyring, KDE Wallet or KeepassXC's Secret Service
# plugin); the launcher deps guarantee a GUI dialog tool exists.
